WEBVTT

01:24.880 --> 01:27.240
ADAPTED FROM THE LEGEND
OF KUNSHAN JADE BY TAN TIANYIN

01:35.040 --> 01:36.240
So,

01:37.360 --> 01:38.320
Yu Shi is in the Western Regions?

01:42.360 --> 01:43.400
I think so.

01:43.480 --> 01:45.080
Then we can meet him
when we go to Western Regions.

01:46.000 --> 01:47.120
I don't know.

02:01.880 --> 02:03.360
I just saw that you

02:03.440 --> 02:05.800
changed this to a weaving process.

02:07.040 --> 02:08.080
It does make it better.

02:17.800 --> 02:19.000
You're complimenting me?

02:23.280 --> 02:24.840
You've been complimenting me lately?

02:26.680 --> 02:28.680
I think you want to get beaten up.
Can't I compliment you?

02:29.760 --> 02:30.680
You can.

02:31.680 --> 02:33.560
It's scary that you praise me every day.

02:34.480 --> 02:35.560
Scary?

02:36.080 --> 02:37.200
Am I that scary?

02:57.400 --> 02:58.560
According to an investigation
of the births,

02:58.640 --> 03:00.720
there are three women in Shaozhou

03:00.800 --> 03:01.760
who are not biological and were adopted.

03:08.480 --> 03:10.080
YUE YUNXIU OF THE YUE FAMILY

03:10.160 --> 03:11.360
Yue Yunxiu.

03:12.560 --> 03:14.760
The Yue family who asked Cui Shijiu
for the pearls?

03:14.840 --> 03:16.720
Yue Yunxiu was well-known
in the jade carving business

03:16.800 --> 03:17.640
in Shaozhou.

03:17.720 --> 03:19.720
She is said to be very skillful.

03:19.800 --> 03:22.520
People call her Jade Guanyin.

03:25.280 --> 03:26.480
It's them.

03:26.560 --> 03:30.480
Yue's may have something
to do with old times.

03:31.600 --> 03:33.320
Yu Shi's Apsaras statue

03:34.040 --> 03:35.720
can be copied only by a few people,

03:38.400 --> 03:40.080
but Yue's is one of them.

03:43.120 --> 03:47.480
YUE'S MANSION

03:55.320 --> 03:57.640
My master would like
to see the master of Yue's

03:57.720 --> 03:58.760
and work with Yue's.

03:59.640 --> 04:02.440
You're here on business

04:02.520 --> 04:03.480
instead of proposal.

04:03.560 --> 04:05.120
Who is to be married?

04:05.200 --> 04:06.520
The master's daughter, Jade Guanyin.

04:11.800 --> 04:12.800
That's also OK.

04:58.360 --> 05:00.400
Lady Shiqi is unrivaled

05:00.480 --> 05:02.200
in jade carving,

05:02.800 --> 05:05.080
known as Jade Guanyin.

05:05.160 --> 05:07.080
The master asked her
to carve jade in public

05:07.600 --> 05:08.560
to choose his future son-in-law.

05:18.040 --> 05:20.600
The woman's skill is truly remarkable.

05:21.480 --> 05:24.720
In full view of the crowd,
she was as free of distractions,

05:25.400 --> 05:26.680
as if no one was around her.

05:27.280 --> 05:28.480
All she cared about was the jade

05:28.560 --> 05:30.680
in her hands and her heart for it.

05:31.960 --> 05:33.200
It was remarkable.

05:37.720 --> 05:39.360
Who wants to see jade carving?

05:39.440 --> 05:41.520
We've come to see beauty.

05:41.600 --> 05:43.040
By marrying Jade Guanyin,

05:43.120 --> 05:44.600
I can have both beauty

05:44.680 --> 05:46.480
and wealth.

05:46.560 --> 05:47.840
It's worth it.

05:47.920 --> 05:49.840
Only if you can marry her.

05:50.600 --> 05:53.240
If I can't, I can see more of her.

06:25.360 --> 06:27.320
I made this for you. Is it beautiful?

06:27.400 --> 06:28.320
Yes.

06:29.160 --> 06:30.720
The two of them make a pair.

06:31.440 --> 06:32.800
Do you like it?

06:34.160 --> 06:36.880
See how nice your brother is to you.

06:37.600 --> 06:39.880
Come on, Zijing. I'll put one on you too.

06:41.400 --> 06:42.840
One for each of us.

06:46.840 --> 06:47.680
Master.

06:49.200 --> 06:50.040
What's wrong?

06:50.120 --> 06:53.120
Lady Shiqi is truly transcendent,

06:53.200 --> 06:54.960
like a rough diamond and unrivaled.

06:55.040 --> 06:56.360
I'll give you 150,000 mace.

06:56.440 --> 06:57.720
Hundred and sixty thousand.

06:57.800 --> 06:59.960
Two hundred thousand.
Two hundred and twenty thousand.

07:00.040 --> 07:01.680
-Two hundred and forty thousand.
-280,000.

07:01.760 --> 07:02.680
Three hundred thousand.

07:02.760 --> 07:04.360
-Four hundred and fifty thousand.
-500,000.

07:04.440 --> 07:05.440
I am Yan Zijing, from Western Regions,

07:06.240 --> 07:08.720
and I ask your permission to marry her.

07:08.800 --> 07:10.240
Western Regions?

07:12.000 --> 07:16.560
My daughter
is the world-famous Jade Guanyin.

07:17.280 --> 07:19.640
She can't be married to just anyone.

07:19.720 --> 07:22.040
And since she is your precious daughter,

07:22.960 --> 07:24.200
Master, please

07:24.840 --> 07:26.720
take care of her

07:27.600 --> 07:30.040
and don't let these fools steal her away.

07:30.120 --> 07:31.360
This man is insulting us.

07:33.440 --> 07:36.000
One must be sincere
in one's love for a beauty,

07:38.120 --> 07:39.080
so I would give

07:39.800 --> 07:41.320
all my assets

07:41.960 --> 07:43.560
to have her.

07:57.920 --> 08:01.840
Please don't exaggerate.

08:03.120 --> 08:04.400
What I say goes.

08:18.080 --> 08:19.280
What I do.

08:23.440 --> 08:24.640
Master, what did you just say?

08:24.720 --> 08:25.920
Offer the bride price.

08:26.000 --> 08:27.240
Do you really want to marry Lady Shiqi?

08:27.320 --> 08:28.600
You fell in love with her

08:28.680 --> 08:29.560
at first sight or…

08:30.800 --> 08:32.960
I don't care what you're after.
At this moment, please don't

08:33.039 --> 08:34.280
-make fun of a woman's reputation.
-Cut the crap.

08:34.360 --> 08:35.440
Do as I say.

08:36.240 --> 08:37.440
I'll marry her for all I've got.

08:37.520 --> 08:39.240
Unbelievable.

08:52.080 --> 08:53.560
What did you talk about in there?

08:53.640 --> 08:54.840
Has Master ever been married?

08:58.480 --> 08:59.520
I don't know.

09:02.720 --> 09:05.160
He's rich and not young.

09:05.960 --> 09:07.880
If he hasn't been married, then why?

09:08.640 --> 09:09.560
I don't know.

09:10.560 --> 09:12.000
He wants to marry Lady Shiqi

09:12.680 --> 09:13.640
and asked me to offer the bride price.

09:15.400 --> 09:16.360
What did you say?

09:16.440 --> 09:18.760
Master wants to marry Lady Shiqi,

09:18.840 --> 09:20.080
even if he has to dump all his money.

09:29.600 --> 09:31.200
For a jade pendant,

09:31.800 --> 09:33.200
you want to marry Lady Shiqi?

09:33.280 --> 09:34.240
What if…

09:36.240 --> 09:38.160
What if she's not your sister?

09:38.240 --> 09:39.680
What if she is?

09:40.920 --> 09:42.000
Can I stand by and watch her being sold?

09:42.080 --> 09:43.560
If she's not, will you still marry her?

09:43.640 --> 09:45.120
I can't care so much now.

09:47.520 --> 09:48.560
It's the fastest way.

09:50.640 --> 09:51.720
Whatever.

09:51.800 --> 09:53.200
Anyway, the Yue family
are not good people.

09:53.880 --> 09:55.000
Did you find out anything?

09:55.080 --> 09:56.600
The best jade carver in the Yue family

09:56.680 --> 09:57.640
was its former master,

09:58.520 --> 09:59.440
but he died too.

10:00.360 --> 10:01.480
Then, let what he owes me be carried on.

10:03.800 --> 10:06.400
Anyone involved in what happened back then

10:08.480 --> 10:09.760
won't live well.

10:18.080 --> 10:19.800
-Sweetheart.
-Dad.

10:23.640 --> 10:26.720
You've improved your skills,

10:27.280 --> 10:29.800
but don't overwork yourself

10:30.560 --> 10:31.840
to the detriment of your health.

10:31.920 --> 10:34.640
I enjoy it and don't find it hard.

10:35.680 --> 10:38.480
Did you find a man of your choice today?

10:41.280 --> 10:42.560
Why do I have to marry?

10:44.800 --> 10:46.640
A woman must marry

10:46.720 --> 10:48.640
when she grows up.

10:48.720 --> 10:50.760
That's a truism.

10:50.840 --> 10:52.640
But I feel good now

10:52.720 --> 10:54.920
that I can carve jade

10:55.000 --> 10:56.080
and stay at home with you.

10:56.160 --> 10:57.240
Company with jade.

10:57.320 --> 10:59.120
But I'm getting old.

10:59.200 --> 11:00.880
You're not.

11:00.960 --> 11:02.560
You and jade

11:02.640 --> 11:04.640
are the most important things to me.

11:05.320 --> 11:06.680
Others are not.

11:14.760 --> 11:15.760
Sweetheart.

11:18.640 --> 11:22.080
If you stray and don't marry,

11:22.160 --> 11:25.560
others will gossip about you

11:25.640 --> 11:27.160
and say

11:27.760 --> 11:31.640
you're destined to be single.
This is unlucky.

11:32.320 --> 11:33.760
This will

11:33.840 --> 11:37.440
also affect your jade

11:38.400 --> 11:40.240
as well as our family.

11:42.720 --> 11:44.880
Then I can get married. I don't care,

11:45.400 --> 11:46.920
but he must allow me
to continue carving jade.

11:48.520 --> 11:49.760
Of course.

11:49.840 --> 11:52.680
Of course.

11:52.760 --> 11:56.120
My daughter
is the world-famous Jade Guanyin,

11:57.400 --> 12:00.080
so who wants your skills to go to waste?

12:01.120 --> 12:03.040
Sweetheart, don't worry.

12:03.640 --> 12:07.360
I will make plans for you

12:07.880 --> 12:09.280
to get your future husband

12:09.920 --> 12:12.440
to support you in your endeavors.

12:18.320 --> 12:22.680
EVERLASTING

12:57.240 --> 12:58.120
Mr. Yue.

13:00.160 --> 13:03.360
My master has heard
of Jade Guanyin in Shaozhou,

13:03.440 --> 13:05.480
so he asked me to bring a gift.

13:06.320 --> 13:08.200
Would you like to see it?

13:09.480 --> 13:10.960
What is it?

13:11.640 --> 13:14.440
Very valuable and unique,

13:15.880 --> 13:17.480
of course.

13:39.320 --> 13:42.920
How old is your master?

13:45.000 --> 13:47.360
-You may want to--
-Not important.

13:49.240 --> 13:52.520
He's good at caring if he's
a few years older than her.

13:53.760 --> 13:58.120
How many wives does your master have?

14:00.120 --> 14:01.080
If his wife--

14:01.160 --> 14:02.920
It doesn't matter.

14:03.000 --> 14:07.080
If he has a big family, it'll be lively.

14:08.280 --> 14:11.560
Does your Master have any ailments?

14:12.320 --> 14:13.320
That

14:14.240 --> 14:15.080
doesn't matter either.

14:18.680 --> 14:20.200
May I ask what is important

14:20.280 --> 14:22.240
when your daughter gets married?

14:22.320 --> 14:24.040
That is your master's sincerity

14:24.120 --> 14:27.720
in the bride price, of course.

14:28.480 --> 14:30.040
This will fully show

14:30.120 --> 14:33.880
his sincerity towards my daughter.

14:33.960 --> 14:35.400
That is sincerity.

14:36.520 --> 14:40.720
Lady Shiqi is Jade Guanyin.

14:41.360 --> 14:44.760
It seems you are not choosing a son-in-law
but selling your daughter.

14:46.600 --> 14:48.680
-You…
-Good women are rare.

14:51.280 --> 14:52.320
Put it away.

14:56.600 --> 14:57.760
Master.

15:02.880 --> 15:04.480
Hello, Mr. Yue.

15:07.000 --> 15:09.120
Master Yan, please take a seat.

15:10.160 --> 15:12.560
Master Yan is such a good-looking

15:12.640 --> 15:14.120
and talented man.

15:14.200 --> 15:18.120
You're not only young and brilliant
but also rich.

15:18.200 --> 15:21.800
Even in Shaozhou…

15:22.960 --> 15:24.080
For the bride price,

15:24.960 --> 15:26.200
you can name your price.

15:30.640 --> 15:32.240
-Fifty thousand gold.
-No problem.

15:35.960 --> 15:36.880
Fifty thousand gold?

15:37.680 --> 15:39.040
-Mr. Yue.
-I agree.

15:41.520 --> 15:43.440
Perfect match. Perfect match.

15:43.520 --> 15:45.480
-Master Yan.
-Mr. Yue.

15:45.560 --> 15:48.840
I've heard that Miss Yue is an orphan

15:49.360 --> 15:50.720
and was adopted by you as a child,

15:51.640 --> 15:53.600
so where did you adopt her?

15:58.840 --> 16:00.320
Someone gave her to me.

16:03.000 --> 16:03.960
Does she

16:05.000 --> 16:06.080
have any other relatives?

16:06.760 --> 16:08.120
No.

16:09.120 --> 16:10.560
This girl

16:10.640 --> 16:13.480
had a terrible childhood.

16:16.360 --> 16:19.760
She was uprooted and nearly killed.

16:20.720 --> 16:24.120
Luckily, I saved her

16:24.200 --> 16:28.040
and raised her.

16:28.120 --> 16:29.640
It wasn't easy.

16:31.800 --> 16:33.320
Master Yan,

16:33.400 --> 16:35.800
so, about the bride price…

16:38.200 --> 16:39.360
Well…

16:39.920 --> 16:41.560
Do you think…

16:43.520 --> 16:45.240
Master Yan, don't worry.

16:45.320 --> 16:48.760
Although Lady Shiqi has no parents,

16:48.840 --> 16:51.560
-her future happiness will be endless.
-That's enough.

16:59.280 --> 17:00.760
I don't care about that.

17:31.960 --> 17:33.440
Do you really want to marry Lady Shiqi?

17:34.920 --> 17:36.880
-Can't I?
-Why?

17:40.400 --> 17:41.560
Because of her skill?

17:41.640 --> 17:43.320
I have no shortage of artisans.

17:43.400 --> 17:44.440
Then why?

17:54.560 --> 17:55.520
What's wrong?

17:55.600 --> 17:58.160
What do you have against
the choice of my future wife?

18:05.280 --> 18:06.520
What's it to me?

18:08.800 --> 18:10.000
I'm just curious as to why

18:11.320 --> 18:13.280
you want to get married so suddenly

18:13.880 --> 18:15.760
and at such great expense.

18:17.440 --> 18:19.840
In three days,
I'm taking her out of Shaozhou.

18:24.000 --> 18:26.040
Do you know how much money
the Yue's family wants?

18:26.120 --> 18:27.200
How can three days be enough?

18:29.080 --> 18:30.120
Is that much?

18:35.920 --> 18:37.280
I want more.

18:40.880 --> 18:43.200
I've been out of Shaozhou
just for half a month

18:43.280 --> 18:44.320
and you do this.

18:44.400 --> 18:45.880
What do you mean?

18:45.960 --> 18:48.480
Master Zhou, you've misunderstood.

18:48.560 --> 18:51.360
Many people like my daughter,

18:51.440 --> 18:54.720
and the matchmakers
are scrambling to introduce men to her,

18:54.800 --> 18:56.280
so I have no choice.

18:56.360 --> 18:57.760
I've already paid the bride price.

18:57.840 --> 19:00.200
I want to see who is qualified
to compete with me.

19:01.760 --> 19:04.120
Please wait at the door.

19:04.720 --> 19:06.680
Just a moment. Just a moment.

19:08.400 --> 19:10.680
Come here. Come here, please.

19:11.400 --> 19:13.360
-Mr. Yue.
-I understand.

19:13.440 --> 19:16.120
-Lady Shiqi--
-I know. I understand.

19:16.200 --> 19:18.960
Now, take the guest to Lady Shiqi.

19:19.040 --> 19:20.040
Now.

19:20.680 --> 19:21.760
Please.

19:23.360 --> 19:24.480
Let's go.

19:29.520 --> 19:30.520
Master Zhou.

19:30.600 --> 19:33.240
Don't just sit there. Eat some fruit.

19:43.960 --> 19:44.960
Lady Shiqi.

19:49.680 --> 19:51.840
I'm Duanwu from Yan's Trading Convoy.

19:53.360 --> 19:54.360
Miss, please wait.

19:54.440 --> 19:56.120
Lady Shiqi is soaking her hands.

19:57.160 --> 19:58.000
That's all right.

19:59.880 --> 20:00.880
Is that goat's milk?

20:02.040 --> 20:03.520
-Goat's milk?
-Yes,

20:03.600 --> 20:04.800
it is.

20:04.880 --> 20:06.760
Poor people can't afford to drink it.

20:06.840 --> 20:07.760
The master has prepared it

20:07.840 --> 20:09.440
especially for Lady Shiqi.

20:13.920 --> 20:14.960
Give it to me.

20:17.560 --> 20:18.640
Lady Shiqi.

20:24.680 --> 20:26.240
It's from my master.

20:27.000 --> 20:29.200
Please choose well.

20:29.760 --> 20:31.160
Lady Shiqi

20:31.240 --> 20:33.360
doesn't like such gaudy things.

20:33.440 --> 20:35.040
She has always worn only white jade.

20:35.840 --> 20:36.800
I happen

20:37.640 --> 20:38.840
to have white jade.

20:38.920 --> 20:40.360
Please take a look. Do you like it?

20:42.200 --> 20:43.640
Thank your master for me.

20:55.080 --> 20:56.760
Aren't you curious

20:56.840 --> 20:58.400
about my master?

21:00.440 --> 21:02.080
As long as he doesn't get in the way
of my jade carving.

21:14.560 --> 21:16.120
Did you cave all the jade

21:17.440 --> 21:19.800
in this room yourself?

21:22.840 --> 21:24.560
Good jade doesn't need to be carved.

21:25.640 --> 21:27.760
This room is full of good jade.

21:28.560 --> 21:31.080
Whether it gets better or worse

21:31.160 --> 21:32.560
depends on the mind of the carver

21:33.440 --> 21:35.120
and the compatibility of the jade.

21:35.960 --> 21:38.320
You deserve to be Jade Guanyin.

21:39.040 --> 21:41.800
I've had an eyeful today.

21:41.880 --> 21:44.480
Feel free to look around if you like.

21:49.680 --> 21:50.720
Really?

22:31.600 --> 22:32.840
This is the Apsaras statue.

22:32.920 --> 22:34.480
It's a replica,

22:34.560 --> 22:37.000
a far cry from the real thing.

22:37.080 --> 22:38.200
The real thing?

22:38.720 --> 22:40.840
Where is the real one?
Can you show it to me?

22:41.520 --> 22:42.440
With my father.

22:50.280 --> 22:51.200
Lady Shiqi.

22:51.280 --> 22:52.640
Master's gifts have been here.

22:52.720 --> 22:54.520
Sorry to bother you. See you later.

22:58.800 --> 22:59.640
Let's go.

23:04.160 --> 23:06.880
The Cui family,
the Yan family, the Yue family,

23:06.960 --> 23:09.080
my mom, and Yu Shi.

23:09.600 --> 23:11.040
What's the relationship between them?

23:12.240 --> 23:14.280
Why does the Yue family
have the Apsaras statue?

23:15.280 --> 23:18.600
-Did Yan Zijing know about it?
-Duanwu.

23:20.640 --> 23:22.280
Did Lady Shiqi take the jewelry?

23:22.360 --> 23:23.360
Did she like them?

23:24.120 --> 23:25.680
From the Cui family to the Yue family,

23:26.880 --> 23:29.600
what did he marry Lady Shiqi for?

23:29.680 --> 23:30.880
Huh?

23:33.720 --> 23:34.720
Master.

23:36.080 --> 23:37.640
Lady Shiqi took all the jewelry,

23:38.720 --> 23:40.280
but her favorite is white jade,

23:41.000 --> 23:42.440
and she only cares about jade carving.

23:43.680 --> 23:44.880
Go to Accountant Wei

23:44.960 --> 23:46.760
and give her all the best white jade
from the trading convoy.

23:47.840 --> 23:48.680
All the white jade?

23:48.760 --> 23:50.400
Now. Go.

23:59.720 --> 24:02.080
About Master Zhou, I've made arrangements.

24:03.280 --> 24:04.200
Good.

24:05.640 --> 24:07.160
Let's go to Yue's Mansion.

24:21.960 --> 24:22.840
Lady Shiqi.

24:24.440 --> 24:25.720
Did you hurt your hand?

24:27.480 --> 24:30.480
Recently, my hand
has been weak all of a sudden.

24:30.560 --> 24:31.440
Weak?

24:31.520 --> 24:33.840
It must be because you've been
working too hard lately.

24:33.920 --> 24:35.600
The master has been reminding you

24:35.680 --> 24:37.680
to have a rest

24:37.760 --> 24:39.680
and not to carve jade day and night.

24:39.760 --> 24:41.520
It hurts your hands.

24:42.200 --> 24:44.120
Come on, Lady Shiqi.

24:44.200 --> 24:45.240
Time to soak your hands.

24:55.000 --> 24:57.480
What is this goat's milk for?

24:58.600 --> 24:59.880
Why do my hands always feel uncomfortable

24:59.960 --> 25:01.520
after soaking them
in goat's milk these days?

25:02.560 --> 25:03.640
This goat's milk

25:03.720 --> 25:05.880
is to condition your skin

25:05.960 --> 25:09.080
and relax your hands.

25:09.160 --> 25:12.240
Moreover, Master has prepared it
especially for you.

25:12.320 --> 25:14.560
Lady Shiqi, don't you even believe
in the Master?

25:16.680 --> 25:18.440
Don't worry.

25:33.200 --> 25:34.760
How long have you been using goat's milk?

25:35.440 --> 25:36.560
A little over a month.

25:37.680 --> 25:38.840
Over a month?

25:40.600 --> 25:41.880
If Lady Shiqi was feeling sick,

25:41.960 --> 25:43.400
why didn't you tell your father?

25:44.000 --> 25:45.520
I told him,

25:47.400 --> 25:49.000
but he said it was normal.

26:08.800 --> 26:11.760
Lady Shiqi.
Look what I've brought you today.

26:12.360 --> 26:14.600
Master has brought you
two of the finest pieces

26:14.680 --> 26:15.720
of white jade on the ship.

26:16.440 --> 26:17.600
I hope you will be happy.

26:19.600 --> 26:21.920
If there's nothing else,
I'll see you later.

26:22.720 --> 26:24.360
Let me take this for you.

26:24.440 --> 26:26.040
Wait. You…

26:27.320 --> 26:28.240
What's going on?

26:29.320 --> 26:30.400
How do you feel?

26:32.440 --> 26:33.840
Master Yan.

26:33.920 --> 26:35.240
Don't be angry.

26:35.320 --> 26:37.520
Our master really doesn't know.
Master Yan.

26:37.600 --> 26:38.920
-He…
-Mr. Yue.

26:39.000 --> 26:41.320
Why didn't you tell me that Master Zhou
was also courting Lady Shiqi?

26:42.240 --> 26:43.520
Master Yan.

26:44.080 --> 26:46.600
He's just a despicable dude.

26:46.680 --> 26:48.880
He's not courting Lady Shiqi

26:48.960 --> 26:50.440
but bullying us.

26:50.520 --> 26:51.960
But merchants
don't compete with officials.

26:52.600 --> 26:54.120
About this marriage,
let's forget about it.

26:54.200 --> 26:57.200
I'll stay out of your business
of selling your daughter.

26:58.400 --> 26:59.840
Master Yan, wait.

27:01.600 --> 27:02.960
You've paid the bride price,

27:03.040 --> 27:04.840
and I've rebuffed the others.

27:04.920 --> 27:08.080
Governor Zhou will not allow Master Zhou

27:08.160 --> 27:09.960
to marry Lady Shiqi.

27:10.600 --> 27:11.960
What will happen

27:12.960 --> 27:15.720
to Lady Shiqi if you withdraw?

27:18.200 --> 27:19.360
Of course,

27:19.960 --> 27:21.080
I love Lady Shiqi.

27:22.720 --> 27:25.680
Good. If you say so,

27:25.760 --> 27:28.520
we can talk about anything else.

27:28.600 --> 27:29.520
OK.

27:31.200 --> 27:32.720
You know,

27:32.800 --> 27:35.160
I've raised her for 16 years.

27:37.080 --> 27:38.840
She's like my own daughter.

27:39.520 --> 27:40.920
If she marries you,

27:41.000 --> 27:45.240
we'll never see each other again.

27:47.680 --> 27:50.560
Give me 50,000 gold and take her away,
as you said before.

27:54.400 --> 27:57.160
You can bargain on the dowry
and bride price.

27:57.240 --> 27:58.240
Don't go.

27:58.320 --> 28:00.000
You can bargain.

28:00.840 --> 28:02.480
If I give you 50,000 gold,

28:03.080 --> 28:04.320
what will be your dowry?

28:07.800 --> 28:08.760
We have a dowry.

28:10.480 --> 28:11.360
Just a moment.

28:26.920 --> 28:28.520
It's a fine piece of jade.

28:28.600 --> 28:31.000
You do love Lady Shiqi.

28:31.080 --> 28:32.880
I'll take these boxes of dowry.

28:32.960 --> 28:34.320
Let's make a note.

28:37.280 --> 28:38.800
A note for the dowry?

28:41.120 --> 28:44.280
You really don't have to

28:44.360 --> 28:45.400
worry about Master Zhou.

28:45.480 --> 28:47.240
Governor Zhou will surely

28:47.320 --> 28:49.480
teach him a good lesson these days.

28:49.560 --> 28:51.760
We should take this opportunity
to finalize the marriage.

28:51.840 --> 28:54.640
In three days, take Lady Shiqi away.

28:54.720 --> 28:56.240
Where can he find you?

28:57.840 --> 28:59.160
What if he comes to you

28:59.960 --> 29:02.360
after I've taken her away?

29:03.280 --> 29:04.320
Don't worry.

29:04.960 --> 29:08.400
He has something on me.

29:14.400 --> 29:15.400
Duanwu.

29:16.200 --> 29:17.880
-Duanwu, let's--
-Come here.

29:17.960 --> 29:18.880
Do you know where the clinic

29:18.960 --> 29:20.280
that can test for drugs is?

29:20.360 --> 29:21.640
Yes, I do. Duanwu, you--

29:21.720 --> 29:24.160
I'm fine. I'll talk to you later.
Take me there. Let's go.

29:24.240 --> 29:25.640
Duanwu, this way.

29:26.520 --> 29:28.880
SHAOZHOU INN

29:28.960 --> 29:30.520
-Come again next time.
-OK.

29:32.840 --> 29:34.400
Poison in the goat's milk?

29:35.920 --> 29:37.840
Lady Shiqi and Mr. Yue…

29:41.480 --> 29:42.960
Why did he poison her?

29:47.480 --> 29:49.360
Jade Guanyin is more valuable

29:50.360 --> 29:51.920
when she no longer carves jade.

29:53.440 --> 29:54.680
After Lady Shiqi's marriage,

29:54.760 --> 29:56.240
she will no longer bear the name Yue,

29:57.160 --> 29:59.280
and Mr. Yue won't let others have that.

30:00.360 --> 30:01.480
In this way,

30:02.600 --> 30:04.760
all his jades can appreciate in value.

30:04.840 --> 30:06.480
He's so evil.

30:08.440 --> 30:09.680
That's his daughter.

30:12.000 --> 30:13.200
I have to save her.

30:13.280 --> 30:14.160
Save her?

30:18.680 --> 30:19.600
Shrimp.

30:19.680 --> 30:21.560
Meet me in the backyard
with Loud tomorrow.

30:21.640 --> 30:23.400
I'll find a way to bring Lady Shiqi out.

30:23.480 --> 30:25.120
-Do you understand me?
-OK.

30:35.480 --> 30:36.360
Master.

30:38.320 --> 30:39.200
Come in.

30:48.480 --> 30:49.600
What's going on?

30:50.840 --> 30:52.920
I have a secret about the Yue family.

30:55.320 --> 30:56.880
It concerns Lady Shiqi's safety.

30:57.600 --> 30:59.680
-Do you want to know?
-Give me that.

31:00.360 --> 31:01.600
If you want to know,

31:02.320 --> 31:03.840
tell me what I want to know first.

31:06.520 --> 31:09.840
What is the relationship
between the Cui's, Yue's, and Yan's?

31:09.920 --> 31:12.080
What do they have to do with my mom?

31:13.320 --> 31:15.120
Who is Yu Shi?

31:15.200 --> 31:16.840
You seem bolder,

31:17.800 --> 31:18.880
don't you?

31:18.960 --> 31:20.760
You dare to make a deal with me now.

31:27.000 --> 31:28.120
Give it to me.

31:28.640 --> 31:29.520
I know

31:30.800 --> 31:31.760
the Apsaras statue in the Yue family.

31:32.600 --> 31:33.720
The Apsaras statue in the Yue family?

31:35.240 --> 31:36.160
How do you know that?

31:36.240 --> 31:37.840
Please tell me what I want to know first.

31:38.480 --> 31:39.320
Give it to me.

32:05.120 --> 32:07.160
Why are you looking up
the Lotus Terrace Apsaras statue?

32:08.040 --> 32:08.920
Tell me.

32:14.160 --> 32:16.240
You're fooling me with this.
What are you doing?

32:16.960 --> 32:18.200
If you hate the Yue family so much,

32:19.240 --> 32:20.920
why did you marry Yue Yunxiu?

32:21.880 --> 32:22.840
What are you doing to the Yue family?

32:23.960 --> 32:25.760
Whether it's the Cui family
or the Yue family,

32:27.120 --> 32:28.920
-they all have to die.
-What about Yue Yunxiu?

32:29.600 --> 32:31.040
It has nothing to do with her.

32:31.120 --> 32:32.240
She knows nothing.

32:34.080 --> 32:35.160
This has nothing to do with you.

32:35.240 --> 32:36.600
Mr. Yue is poisoning her.

32:37.400 --> 32:38.520
It's Muscle Weakening Powder.

32:41.400 --> 32:43.520
Mr. Yue is going to destroy her hand.

32:57.600 --> 33:00.760
Master. There's a man from Jinyang
named Zhang Si wanting to see you.

33:01.920 --> 33:03.000
Jinyang?

33:03.960 --> 33:07.000
Has Lady Shiqi's reputation
spread this far?

33:07.600 --> 33:08.480
But it makes sense.

33:09.040 --> 33:12.160
Even the rich merchants
of the Western Regions are courting her.

33:13.200 --> 33:14.040
Of course.

33:14.120 --> 33:16.560
Everyone knows you have a Jade Guanyin.

33:17.120 --> 33:17.960
Okay.

33:18.040 --> 33:20.000
Let him in.

33:20.760 --> 33:22.560
-Yes, sir.
-Come on.

33:23.240 --> 33:24.120
Put the lid on.

33:35.000 --> 33:35.880
Mr. Yue.

33:40.440 --> 33:42.760
Mr. Zhang, what can I do for you?

33:42.840 --> 33:44.440
Ten tael of pearls.

33:45.720 --> 33:47.000
Ten tael of pearls?

33:48.240 --> 33:49.880
What do you mean?

34:00.200 --> 34:02.640
CUI

34:05.720 --> 34:07.400
You're from the Cui family?

34:09.080 --> 34:10.360
Hey, you.

34:10.440 --> 34:11.360
Go away.

34:15.800 --> 34:17.880
I am asking them to find you.

34:17.960 --> 34:20.600
You sent the pearls
so long after Cui Ding died.

34:20.679 --> 34:21.800
It's too late.

34:22.480 --> 34:23.920
I still have to go to Yangzhou

34:24.000 --> 34:25.320
to talk to your patriarch.

34:25.400 --> 34:27.960
That's enough. Where are the pearls?

34:28.760 --> 34:29.679
Where are the pearls?

34:29.760 --> 34:31.960
Didn't you meet Lady Shijiu in Guangzhou?

34:32.040 --> 34:34.080
How dare you mention that?

34:34.600 --> 34:36.480
You've hired a guy of unknown gender

34:36.560 --> 34:38.239
to work there.

34:38.320 --> 34:39.239
She knows nothing.

34:40.440 --> 34:41.520
Then, what should we know?

34:41.600 --> 34:43.600
What do you know?

34:46.760 --> 34:48.960
I know that Cui's Pearl Farm gives
you ten tael of pearls every year,

34:49.760 --> 34:50.719
but you don't know

34:50.800 --> 34:52.920
that Cui's Pearl Farm is suspected
of fraud in tribute pearls.

34:53.000 --> 34:55.239
His Holiness has already sent people
to Hepu to investigate.

34:56.000 --> 34:57.000
I don't know

34:58.040 --> 34:59.120
if you are involved.

35:06.640 --> 35:09.440
So, you're not from the Cui family?

35:09.520 --> 35:10.640
Of course not.

35:12.480 --> 35:13.920
I'm here to investigate the Cui family.

35:14.440 --> 35:16.200
Then, who are you?

35:16.280 --> 35:18.320
The Institute of Literary Studies'
bachelor, Zhang Jinran.

35:18.400 --> 35:19.960
I've been ordered by Prince Ying

35:20.040 --> 35:21.520
to investigate Cui's Pearl Farm
and tribute pearls.

35:29.480 --> 35:30.760
Please.

35:31.840 --> 35:32.760
You…

35:33.400 --> 35:36.200
We have nothing to do
with Cui's Pearl Farm.

35:36.280 --> 35:39.280
Then, how do you explain
about ten tael of pearls?

35:40.720 --> 35:43.200
It's all normal business.

35:43.840 --> 35:47.560
We supply Cui's Pearl Farm
with fine jade every year,

35:47.640 --> 35:50.640
and Cui's Pearl Farm gives
ten tael of pearls to us every year.

35:50.720 --> 35:51.880
Normal business?

35:53.880 --> 35:55.480
These pearls are tribute pearls.

35:56.840 --> 35:59.640
When it comes to tribute pearls,
I must investigate properly.

36:01.640 --> 36:03.320
It's…

36:03.400 --> 36:04.600
I…

36:04.680 --> 36:09.040
I really didn't know
they were tribute pearls.

36:09.120 --> 36:10.800
How did I know that Cui Jingchu

36:10.880 --> 36:14.560
dared use these tribute pearls
to cover his debt?

36:17.080 --> 36:20.040
You should investigate him.

36:20.120 --> 36:22.160
I don't know the inside story.

36:23.320 --> 36:24.720
Do you really not know,

36:27.000 --> 36:28.720
or are you pretending not to know?

36:29.480 --> 36:30.640
Mr. Yue.

36:30.720 --> 36:32.920
Think carefully before you answer me.

36:37.200 --> 36:38.120
I really don't know.

36:48.160 --> 36:50.200
This time, Cui's Pearl Farm is suspected
of tribute pearl fraud,

36:50.280 --> 36:53.400
so the court's deficit from previous years
needs to be made up.

36:53.480 --> 36:56.040
Since you receive ten tael of pearls
from Cui's Pearl Farm every year,

36:56.680 --> 36:58.480
you need to pay this money.

37:01.680 --> 37:03.440
How much?

37:03.520 --> 37:04.440
Not much.

37:05.000 --> 37:06.240
Forty million mace.

37:06.880 --> 37:09.320
The government will give you
the official paperwork later.

37:12.200 --> 37:13.520
It's…

37:13.600 --> 37:16.720
It's going to wipe out

37:16.800 --> 37:18.760
the Yue family.

37:22.680 --> 37:25.080
They're killing me.

37:25.160 --> 37:27.000
So, it depends on whether you want

37:27.080 --> 37:28.840
to keep your money or your life.

37:28.920 --> 37:31.040
Tribute pearls can be made good,

37:31.120 --> 37:33.960
but if they involve something else,
it's too late.

37:38.600 --> 37:39.560
Mr. Yue.

37:40.640 --> 37:42.320
You really need to think about

37:42.920 --> 37:45.760
what fine jade you have to make
every year to make up

37:45.840 --> 37:47.920
for this ten tael of pearls.

37:50.000 --> 37:52.640
When you do, feel free to come to me.

37:59.760 --> 38:04.480
Looks like Zhang Jinran
really is Prince Ying's man.

38:04.560 --> 38:07.360
YUE'S MANSION

38:07.440 --> 38:08.760
-Duanwu.
-Mr. Zhang.

38:08.840 --> 38:09.880
Why are you here?

38:10.480 --> 38:12.520
I just came to Shaozhou,
but didn't expect to run into you again.

38:12.600 --> 38:14.520
Mr. Zhang,
I really have something to do today,

38:14.600 --> 38:15.600
so let's talk about it some other time.

38:21.720 --> 38:23.360
Why is Mr. Zhang at Yue's house?

38:25.280 --> 38:26.640
I have something to ask Mr. Yue.

38:28.000 --> 38:30.360
Is Mr. Zhang investigating the Yue family?

38:30.440 --> 38:31.600
What have you found out?

38:32.360 --> 38:33.800
Did you know about the Yan family
in Yangzhou?

38:35.400 --> 38:36.240
What did you find out?

38:39.840 --> 38:42.480
The Yan family was the newest jeweler
in Yangzhou

38:43.160 --> 38:44.120
and traded with the Western Regions

38:44.200 --> 38:45.960
to bring in a lot of novelty jewelry.

38:46.040 --> 38:47.800
Their unique styles
took Yangzhou by storm.

38:47.880 --> 38:49.560
Within a few years,

38:49.640 --> 38:51.440
they had made a name for themselves
in the Yangzhou jewelry market

38:52.160 --> 38:54.520
and might overtake established jewelers
like the Cui and Zheng families.

38:54.600 --> 38:56.720
They also helped the two countries
make friends

38:57.320 --> 38:59.280
by trading with the Western Regions
and helping the State of Kang

38:59.360 --> 39:01.720
to bring gifts to Tang. The Yan family

39:02.440 --> 39:04.920
would have become the hottest in Chang'an
if they had succeeded,

39:05.520 --> 39:06.440
but the gift was shattered

39:07.160 --> 39:09.600
in public during a ceremony

39:09.680 --> 39:10.520
at the Imperial Palace.

39:11.280 --> 39:12.560
After an investigation,

39:13.240 --> 39:15.320
it was discovered
that even the tribute jade was a fake.

39:15.400 --> 39:16.640
The Emperor was furious

39:17.520 --> 39:19.240
and blamed the Yan family,

39:19.320 --> 39:21.320
but at that time,
no one in the Yan family had survived.

39:21.960 --> 39:22.880
The case…

39:23.600 --> 39:24.800
The case became an open one.

39:26.200 --> 39:27.440
Is the gift
the Lotus Terrace Apsaras statue?

39:27.520 --> 39:28.640
Yes.

39:29.320 --> 39:30.400
So,

39:33.000 --> 39:36.400
the Yan family is the former owner
of Cui's Pearl Farm?

39:37.120 --> 39:38.000
That's right.

39:40.720 --> 39:43.880
Please spare me for your wife's sake.

39:43.960 --> 39:45.840
How dare you mention my mother?

39:45.920 --> 39:47.320
I also know a secret.

39:47.920 --> 39:48.960
Your sister is still alive.

39:49.040 --> 39:51.280
I am Yan Zijing, from Western Regions,
and I ask your permission to marry her.

39:51.360 --> 39:52.800
Do you really want to marry Lady Shiqi?

39:52.880 --> 39:53.920
Can't I?

39:54.000 --> 39:55.080
Why?

39:58.720 --> 40:02.000
Do you really have nothing to do
with the Yan family in Yangzhou?

40:02.080 --> 40:05.400
They've all been executed.

40:05.480 --> 40:07.080
No one survived.

40:07.160 --> 40:08.800
What do I have to do with them?

40:09.440 --> 40:11.520
If you'd taken care of it last night,

40:13.840 --> 40:15.360
it wouldn't be like this today,

40:16.000 --> 40:18.440
and I'd have succeeded
with the merchants from South Sea.

40:19.680 --> 40:21.080
It wasn't enough.

40:22.840 --> 40:23.800
Wasn't enough?

40:27.880 --> 40:29.280
Duanwu?

40:31.760 --> 40:32.800
Duanwu?

40:33.960 --> 40:35.400
Have you found something?

40:39.960 --> 40:42.280
Mr. Zhang. Thank you

40:42.360 --> 40:43.360
for telling me so much,

40:43.440 --> 40:45.120
but I'm really in a hurry.

40:45.200 --> 40:46.280
Let's talk about it some other time.

40:46.880 --> 40:47.760
Duanwu.

41:00.400 --> 41:01.320
My hand.

41:01.400 --> 41:02.400
My hand.

41:03.080 --> 41:04.680
What's wrong with my hand?

41:04.760 --> 41:06.320
Why can't I feel my hand?

41:06.400 --> 41:08.360
My hand. Look at my hand.

41:08.440 --> 41:10.160
Why can't I even hold a carving knife?

41:10.240 --> 41:11.240
My hand.

41:12.000 --> 41:12.840
My hand.

41:13.360 --> 41:14.240
What's wrong with my hand?

41:14.320 --> 41:15.640
-Does it hurt? Let me see.
-My hand.

41:15.720 --> 41:17.480
Why can't I even

41:17.560 --> 41:18.760
-hold a carving knife?
-Come with me.

41:18.840 --> 41:19.880
-I'm going to my dad.
-Lady Shiqi.

41:19.960 --> 41:21.160
-I'm going to my dad.
-Lady Shiqi.

41:21.240 --> 41:23.360
-Lady Shiqi. Yue Yunxiu.
-Gonna go to my dad.

41:24.160 --> 41:25.240
Look at me.

41:25.320 --> 41:27.720
I'll take you to the best clinic
in Haozhou.

41:27.800 --> 41:28.800
Don't be afraid.

41:31.520 --> 41:32.440
Let's go.

41:33.160 --> 41:34.040
Come on.

41:37.720 --> 41:39.000
Master Zhou's jade has arrived.

41:40.120 --> 41:41.240
It's all fake.

41:45.640 --> 41:46.840
A coward.

41:46.920 --> 41:48.800
He told us all about his work
with the Yue family

41:48.880 --> 41:51.320
and easily wrote the testimonial

41:51.400 --> 41:53.160
before we did anything.

42:09.160 --> 42:10.040
Mr. Yue.

42:16.680 --> 42:18.440
My good son-in-law.

42:18.520 --> 42:19.760
You are flattering me.

42:19.840 --> 42:21.120
I have come today

42:21.200 --> 42:23.400
to ask you about one thing.

42:25.160 --> 42:26.800
Please speak.

42:28.840 --> 42:30.000
A few days ago, I wanted to buy

42:30.080 --> 42:31.520
the White Jade Lotus Cup

42:31.600 --> 42:33.080
for Miss Yue.

42:33.160 --> 42:34.560
I thought it was worthy

42:34.640 --> 42:36.320
of the name Jade Guanyin,

42:38.520 --> 42:41.240
but I was deceived.

42:42.240 --> 42:43.520
Who would be so bold

42:43.600 --> 42:45.240
as to deceive Master Yan?

42:53.200 --> 42:54.200
You.
